# Production build-time configuration for the static Cloudflare deployment.
#
# Vite bakes VITE_API_URL into the bundle at `npm run build` time. Cloudflare's
# static-assets deployment rebuilds from this committed file, so the production
# frontend talks to the existing Google Apps Script Web App exactly like local dev.
#
# The Apps Script /exec URL is NOT a secret — it is a public API endpoint. All
# authentication/authorization is enforced inside the Apps Script backend, so it
# is safe to commit here. Secrets stay inside Apps Script, never in the frontend.
#
# If you set VITE_API_URL as a Cloudflare build-time environment variable in the
# dashboard, that value takes precedence and this file is just the fallback.
VITE_API_URL=https://script.google.com/macros/s/AKfycby1Q-TnSsZ4mSVetJtqg-8k6YauT4qacDQHry-h0L4fUJdlrwGJjV3LS0kaijP8Ugmc/exec
